  "description": "The Falco Sport flat bar is your gateway to fuss free, comfortable, and fast commuting or just hacking about on the road. A frame built for confident handling with relaxed road geometry paired to a wide flat bar gives you superb control. The hydroformed 6061 alloy frame fitted with a full carbon fork makes for very lightweight heart.\nBuilt using Shimano’s Claris 16 speed gearing and Tektro dual pivot road calipers the Falco has smooth and reliable shifting and all the stopping power you need. The compact 50/34 forged chainset matched to 12-32t cassette give all the range you’ll need with a sealed bottom bracket to keep things reliable.\nKenda 28c all season tyres make for reliable grip all year round, mounted to our Reid double wall rim brake wheelset to give a light and lively ride. Who said flat bar bikes cant have great performance? The Falco Sport flat bar with its black on black looks and hidden performance makes for effortless cycling that will surprise you.",
